From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:05:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mb/lenovo/m720q_m920q: Enable LTR on the PCIe root ports

The devicetree does not set PcieRpLtrEnable, so FSP-S leaves Latency
Tolerance Reporting off on the root ports: the devices behind them (the
NVMe SSD, the Wi-Fi card) support LTR but cannot enable it, ASPM L1.2
stays off with it, and the package does not go below PC3 at idle while
the cores sit in C10. The OEM firmware enables LTR on every port (its
setup has "Enable LTR"). Enable it on the four ports in use.

TEST=On an M920x running the build before this, DevCap2 shows LTR- on
the root ports 00:1b.0 and 00:1c.0, and LTR+ but disabled on the NVMe
SSD and the Wi-Fi card behind them, L1.2 off; in 20 s at idle the
package spends 93% in PC3 and none in PC6 to PC10, with the cores 96%
in C10. Built lenovo/m920x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/mainboard/lenovo/m720q_m920q/devicetree.cb | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/mainboard/lenovo/m720q_m920q/devicetree.cb b/src/mainboard/lenovo/m720q_m920q/devicetree.cb
index c299a380a7..8aab48aa70 100644
--- a/src/mainboard/lenovo/m720q_m920q/devicetree.cb
+++ b/src/mainboard/lenovo/m720q_m920q/devicetree.cb
@@ -71,24 +71,28 @@ chip soc/intel/cannonlake
 
 		device ref pcie_rp6	on # WLAN
 			register "PcieRpSlotImplemented[5]"	= "true"
+			register "PcieRpLtrEnable[5]"		= "true"
 			register "PcieClkSrcUsage[3]"		= "5"
 			register "PcieClkSrcClkReq[3]"		= "3"
 		end
 
 		device ref pcie_rp9	on # PCIe x4
 			register "PcieRpSlotImplemented[8]"	= "true"
+			register "PcieRpLtrEnable[8]"		= "true"
 			register "PcieClkSrcUsage[2]"		= "8"
 			register "PcieClkSrcClkReq[2]"		= "2"
 		end
 
 		device ref pcie_rp17 on # M.2 SSD #2
 			register "PcieRpSlotImplemented[16]"	= "true"
+			register "PcieRpLtrEnable[16]"		= "true"
 			register "PcieClkSrcUsage[10]"		= "16"
 			register "PcieClkSrcClkReq[10]"		= "10"
 		end
 
 		device ref pcie_rp21 on # M.2 SSD #1
 			register "PcieRpSlotImplemented[20]"	= "true"
+			register "PcieRpLtrEnable[20]"		= "true"
 			register "PcieClkSrcUsage[4]"		= "20"
 			register "PcieClkSrcClkReq[4]"		= "4"
 		end
